to make simulation look like real data, FORMAT_MASK += 8. Current implementation suppresses SIM_XXX keys in the output, but does not suppress SIMGEN-DUMP, nor the README keys with sim info. These auxiliary files might accidentally be used in analysis codes to cheat. To make sure that analysis codes cannot cheat on blind sim;

1. rename VERSION.README  HIDE.README and create separate README that has no sim information.
2. rename VERSION.DUMP  HIDE.DUMP

